    "subsection": "1",
    "part": "Part IV — Procedure At Election",
    "title": "Conduct and postponement of election in emergency",
    "text": "In the event of an emergency affecting an election, the Commission shall, as far as practicable, ensure that persons displaced as a result of the emergency are not disenfranchised.",
