    "subsection": "1",
    "part": "Part IV — Procedure At Election",
    "title": "Submission of list of candidates and their affidavits by political parties",
    "text": "Every political party shall, not later than 120 days before the date appointed for a general election under this Act, submit to the Commission, in the prescribed Forms, the list of the candidates the party proposes to sponsor at the elections, who shall have emerged from valid primaries conducted by the political party.",
