    "part": "Part IV — Procedure At Election",
    "title": "Submission of list of candidates and their affidavits by political parties",
    "text": "The list or information submitted by each candidate shall be accompanied by an affidavit sworn to by the candidate at the Federal High Court, High Court of a State, or Federal Capital Territory, indicating that he or she has fulfilled all the constitutional requirements for election into that office.",
