    "subsection": "3",
    "part": "Part IV — Procedure At Election",
    "title": "Submission of list of candidates and their affidavits by political parties",
    "text": "The Commission shall, within 21 days of the receipt of the personal particulars of the candidate, publish same in the constituency where the candidate intends to contest the election.",
