    "subsection": "4",
    "part": "Part IV — Procedure At Election",
    "title": "Submission of list of candidates and their affidavits by political parties",
    "text": "Any person may apply to the Commission for a copy of nomination form, affidavit and any other document submitted by a candidate at an election and the Commission shall, upon payment of a prescribed fee, issue such person with a certified true copy of the document within 14 days.",
