    "subsection": "1",
    "part": "Part IV — Procedure At Election",
    "title": "Prohibition of double nomination",
    "text": "A candidate for an election shall be nominated in writing by such number of persons whose names appear on the register of voters in the constituency as the Commission may prescribe.",
