    "subsection": "3",
    "part": "Part IV — Procedure At Election",
    "title": "Prohibition of double nomination",
    "text": "Any person who contravenes subsection (2) commits an offence and is liable on conviction to a fine not more than ₦100,000 or imprisonment for a term of three months or both, but his or her action shall not invalidate the nomination.",
