    "part": "Part IV — Procedure At Election",
    "title": "Prohibition of double nomination",
    "text": "An account shall not be taken of the signature of a person on a nomination paper where the candidate had died, withdrawn or the nomination paper was held invalid by a Court of competent jurisdiction.",
