    "subsection": "1",
    "part": "Part IV — Procedure At Election",
    "title": "Establishment of polling units",
    "text": "The Commission shall divide each Local Government Area into registration areas or Electoral Wards not being less than 10 and not more than 20 as the circumstance of the Local Government Area may require.",
