    "part": "Part IV — Procedure At Election",
    "title": "Ballot boxes and voting devices",
    "text": "Polling agents who are in attendance at a polling unit, may be entitled, before the commencement of the election, to have originals of electoral materials to be used by the Commission for the election inspected, and this process may be recorded as evidence in writing, on video or by other means by any Polling Agent, accredited observer or official of the Commission.",
