    "subsection": "5",
    "part": "Part IV — Procedure At Election",
    "title": "Format of ballot papers",
    "text": "A political party that fails to comply with an invitation by the Commission under subsection (3) shall be deemed to have approved its identity on samples of electoral materials proposed to be used for an election.",
