    "title": "Symbols of political parties",
    "text": "The Commission shall register the symbol and names of a political party if it is satisfied that — (a) no other symbol and name of the same design is registered; (b) the symbol and name is distinctive from any other symbol already registered; and (c) its use will not be offensive or otherwise objectionable.",
