    "part": "Part V — Political Parties",
    "title": "Election expenses of political parties",
    "text": "Election expenses of a political party shall be submitted to the Commission in a separate audited return within six months after the election and such return shall be signed by the political party’s auditors and countersigned by the Chairman of the party and be supported by a sworn affidavit by the signatories as to the correctness of its contents.",
