    "subsection": "1",
    "part": "Part V — Political Parties",
    "title": "Limitation on political broadcast and campaign by political parties",
    "text": "For the purpose of this Act, the period of campaigning in public by every political party shall commence 150 days before polling day and end 24 hours prior to that day.",
