    "title": "Procedure for nomination",
    "text": "Where at the close of nomination for election to the office of Chairman, only one candidate — (a) has been nominated; or (b) remains nominated by reason of the disqualification, withdrawal, incapacitation, disappearance, or death of the other candidate, the Commission shall extend the time for nomination by seven days: Provided that where after the extension, only one candidate remains validly nominated, there shall be no further extension.",
