    "text": "Where the persons duly elected as Chairman and Vice-Chairman of an Area Council die before taking and subscribing the oath of allegiance and oath of office during which period the Area Council has not been inaugurated, the Commission shall within 21 days conduct an election to fill the vacancies.",
