    "part": "Part VI — Procedure For Election To Area Council",
    "title": "Removal of Chairman or Vice-Chairman",
    "text": "A motion of the Area Legislative Council that the allegation be investigated shall not be declared as having been passed unless it is supported by the votes of not less than two-thirds majority of all the members of the Area Legislative Council.",
